OL,3,GNEWSAProtesters disperse after blocking
OL,4,Acontroversial Orange Order parade
OL,5,
OL,6,FA controversial parade organised by
OL,7,FNorthern Ireland's Orange Order is
OL,8,Fdelayed as hundreds of protesters block
OL,9,Fits route in Portadown
OL,11,FThe Orange Order says it's
OL,12,F"disappointed and frustrated" by what
OL,13,Fit says is a lack of a "proper policing
OL,14,Fplan" but vows to "complete our 1998
OL,15,Fparade"
OL,17,FNorthern Ireland First Minister
OL,18,FMichelle O'Neill, who is among the
OL,19,Fdemonstrators, has urged protesters to
OL,20,F"stay the course" until "at least"
OL,21,Fmidnight and says she "stands with the
OL,22,Fresidents"
OL,23,APub: 27-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/4
OL,24,ANext PageB NI NewsC Reg TVF On This Day
FL,413,410,260,120,0,100
