OL,2,W//%*// //%Q%* ** %-,*,$%** %-& (,,,,,,,
OL,3,GNEWSAProtesters disperse after blocking
OL,4,Acontroversial Orange Order parade
OL,5,
OL,6,FNI Secretary of State Sir Chris Bryant
OL,7,Fhas called for both sides to "double
OL,8,Fdown on compromise" - he has returned
OL,9,Ffrom the Labour Party conference to
OL,10,Fhave meetings with local leaders
OL,12,FPolice are calling for protesters to
OL,13,Fdisperse - the march will go ahead when
OL,14,Fthe road is clear, the Orange Order
OL,15,Fsays. A "sterile zone" is in place to
OL,16,Fkeep the two sides apart
OL,23,APub: 27-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/4
OL,24,ANext PageB NI NewsC Reg TVF On This Day
FL,413,410,260,120,0,100
