OL,3,GNEWSAProtesters disperse after blocking
OL,4,Acontroversial Orange Order parade
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe DUP has criticised Sinn Fein's
OL,7,Fparticipation in the protest, and Carla
OL,8,FLockhart MP says there will be
OL,9,F"profound" consequences if the Parade
OL,10,FCommission's determination is not
OL,11,Fupheld
OL,13,FMeanwhile, Social Democratic and Labour
OL,14,FParty leader Claire Hanna says her
OL,15,Fparty is calling for an international
OL,16,Fmediator to help resolve the dispute
OL,17,Fand the UUP says Stormont has been "put
OL,18,Funder threat"
OL,23,APub: 27-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG3/4
OL,24,ANext PageB NI NewsC Reg TVF On This Day
