OL,3,GNEWSAProtesters disperse after blocking
OL,4,Acontroversial Orange Order parade
OL,5,
OL,6,FIn the 1990s, the Drumcree parade
OL,7,Fsparked some of the most serious
OL,8,Fdisorder in Northern Ireland's history
OL,9,F- how did we get here?
OL,23,APub: 27-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG4/4
